DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the bold\, fast-talking\, and unapologetic world of 
 Arynne Wexler. A viral sensation and a rising voice in the world of cultura
 l commentary\, Arynne has built a massive following by saying exactly what'
 s on her mind.\n\nArynne's style is high-energy and conversational\, making
  you feel like you're listening to a friend who isn't afraid to stir the po
 t. She has a special talent for looking at the world through a different le
 ns\, often finding the funny side of serious debates and proving you don't 
 have to follow the crowd to be heard.\n\nWith degrees from Wharton & Penn a
 nd a background spanning the trading floor at Goldman Sachs to the startups
  of Silicon Valley\, Arynne doesn't just share her opinions - she invites e
 veryone to think deeper while having a laugh along the way.\n\nHer voice is
  making waves. Catch her live.\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium
  seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket
  Protection\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers from ente
 ring the facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\n
